  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758964,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10 Most Wanted (PlayStation 2)\n\nStep into the boots of a modern-day operative in *10 Most Wanted*, a realistic first-person shooter developed by the team behind *X-Files: Resist or Serve* and *Black Dawn*. This PlayStation 2 exclusive plunges you into a global manhunt, chasing down eleven notorious terrorist leaders, culminating in a confrontation with Osama Bin Laden.\n\nThe game’s narrative takes you across the globe, from the war-torn landscapes of Afghanistan to the bustling streets of Paris and Miami, as you relentlessly pursue a criminal network. Experience intense firefights and strategic gameplay as you track your targets. Beyond the core first-person shooting action, *10 Most Wanted* introduces a unique third-person hand-to-hand combat mini-game, adding variety to the gameplay. \n\nDelve deeper into the world with an extensive behind-the-scenes video library, offering insights into the game's development and the realities of modern warfare. Prepare for a gritty and immersive experience as you hunt down the world's most dangerous criminals."
    },
